Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,Main,0,0,0,,---- Main ----
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.47,0:00:06.21,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,早安！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.21,0:00:07.35,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.35,0:00:08.73,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.73,0:00:11.47,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,什麼嘛 葵衣 妳這不是恢復精神了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.47,0:00:14.85,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,因為妳難得這麼安靜 我們都很擔心耶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.85,0:00:17.86,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,抱歉抱歉 我已經恢復正常了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.13,0:00:22.14,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,莉莉也很擔心妳 所以才沒什麼精神
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:25.63,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,別太讓莉莉為妳操心啊 男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.63,0:00:27.42,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,誰是男朋友啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:34.48,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,太好了… 兩個人都恢復精神了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:39.14,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不過 要是狀況一直那樣 我也很難去遊樂場了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:43.61,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,遊樂場？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:46.40,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,難不成…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.08,0:00:51.79,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,今天放學後也要去遊樂場嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.79,0:00:53.12,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,要去！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:54.72,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,加賀同學也要來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:55.74,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,會啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.31,0:00:58.01,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,喂 妳們幾個！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.73,0:01:03.95,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,妳們該不會是打算要去遊樂場吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.95,0:01:06.41,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,班… 班長…！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.41,0:01:10.79,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我早就從 PTA 那邊收到報告了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.41,0:01:10.79,Comment,Hotaru,0,0,0,,※ 家長教師聯誼會
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.79,0:01:14.66,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,說我們學校的學生在遊樂場聚集逗留
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:15.30,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,唔…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.30,0:01:20.48,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,沒想到竟然是我們班的莉莉同學和草壁同學…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.66,0:01:23.58,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,竟然是妳們…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.57,0:01:25.55,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,傷心！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.55,0:01:26.56,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,難過！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.56,0:01:27.94,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,真是可嘆！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.94,0:01:29.31,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,氣勢好驚人！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.31,0:01:31.24,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,沒那麼誇張吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:33.83,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,又不是校規禁止的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:37.30,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,不對！ 妳們根本是沒常識的化身！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:38.80,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,有… 有那麼嚴重嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.27,0:01:42.66,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,妳是… 班長是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.49,0:01:45.46,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,妳就是因為腦筋太死板
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.46,0:01:47.62,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,才沒看見事情的本質啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.62,0:01:49.46,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,妳… 妳說什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.72,0:01:52.22,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,對這傢伙來說
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:56.40,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,去遊樂場也是很棒的異文化交流的一環啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.40,0:01:57.12,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.46,0:01:58.17,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,咦…？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.17,0:02:01.58,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,可不是只有坐在書桌前才叫學習
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.58,0:02:03.60,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,對這個從國外來的傢伙來說
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.60,0:02:05.71,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,一切都是學習的場所！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.96,0:02:09.73,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,可… 可是就算這樣 也不用特地去遊樂場吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:11.32,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,所以說啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:13.75,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我才帶她去各式各樣的地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.75,0:02:16.60,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,只是剛好在遊樂場的時候被看到罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:17.60,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,原…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:19.77,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,原來如此…？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.39,0:02:22.41,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那事情就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.41,0:02:23.88,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我們走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.22,0:02:26.67,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,請… 請等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:27.49,Text,Aoi & Karin & Lily,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.55,0:02:33.25,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,既然如此 那我跟妳們去遊樂場應該也沒問題吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.25,0:02:34.12,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,蛤！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.47,0:02:35.89,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,身為班長
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.89,0:02:38.31,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,妳們到底在進行什麼樣的學習
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.31,0:02:40.51,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我要好好地親眼確認！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:35.17,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.17,0:04:36.19,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳在發呆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.19,0:04:37.63,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,沒… 沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:40.47,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,只是覺得比想像中還普通
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.47,0:04:42.75,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,妳沒來過遊樂場嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:45.29,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳以為是什麼樣子？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:47.75,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,嗯… 我以為會更像…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.30,0:04:50.18,Text,Punk Student,0,0,0,,喔啦喔啦喔啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.47,0:04:52.80,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我以為是這種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.80,0:04:54.84,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我從沒看過那種不良少年好嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.84,0:04:57.21,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我覺得妳有偏見喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.14,0:05:00.40,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我承認我有偏見！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:01.91,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.17,0:05:05.89,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我不認為在這種全是遊戲的地方能夠學習！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.89,0:05:07.29,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,為什麼一臉得意的樣子…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.88,0:05:11.71,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,嗯… 有沒有什麼能學習的遊戲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.05,0:05:13.95,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳們的話我都聽到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.95,0:05:15.00,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.19,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哥哥！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.19,0:05:17.20,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,店員先生…？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.20,0:05:19.17,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,如果是能學習的遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:20.84,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我正好知道一個喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.11,0:05:21.95,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.52,0:05:29.70,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這是… 問答遊戲？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:33.57,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,嘿 這個的話確實好像能學到東西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.57,0:05:35.59,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,有各種不同類型的問答題
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.97,0:05:39.16,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,可以和朋友協力或對戰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.60,0:05:43.57,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,反正也是第一次玩 就玩協力模式吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:46.36,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,知道答案的人就按下按鈕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:47.65,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,好呀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:48.83,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.34,0:05:58.63,Text,Game,0,0,0,,問題：「顧頭不顧尾」這句話原本是指什麼動物？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.63,0:06:03.19,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,雖然知道這句諺語… 但從沒在意過詞源啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.19,0:06:05.83,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,大… 大家會知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:10.88,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,咦！？ 莉莉同學竟然知道諺語？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.55,0:06:14.89,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,無尾熊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:21.20,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,等一下… 日本的諺語裡怎麼可能出現無尾熊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:23.02,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊… 對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.02,0:06:24.91,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,沒關係啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:28.39,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,對啊 對啊 只是遊戲嘛 答錯也沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.39,0:06:29.59,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.59,0:06:33.34,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,啊… 對啊 答錯也沒關係…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.65,0:06:37.73,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這不是學習也不是練習 只是遊戲…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.20,0:06:41.79,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,說得也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.25,0:06:43.36,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,莉莉同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.83,0:06:46.16,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,對… 對不起！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.83,0:06:46.16,Text-English,Hotaru,0,0,0,,I… I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.89,0:06:50.27,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,沒關係 下一題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.99,0:06:53.46,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,啊 好的
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.78,0:06:58.83,Text,Game,0,0,0,,戴在手腕上的飾品叫「手鐲」
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.83,0:07:01.77,Text,Game,0,0,0,,戴在腳踝上的飾品叫什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.77,0:07:03.23,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,腳鏈！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.17,0:07:05.02,Top,Game,0,0,0,,正確
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.77,0:07:10.65,Text,Game,0,0,0,,日文「サボる」源自哪個法文單字？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.77,0:07:10.65,Text-English,Game,0,0,0,,{\pos(788,945)}saboru
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.65,0:07:12.08,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,Sabotage！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.77,0:07:13.65,Top,Game,0,0,0,,正確
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:14.99,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,做的好！
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.93,0:07:14.99,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.99,0:07:16.40,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳真厲害 竟然知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.40,0:07:17.99,Top,Karin,0,0,0,,小菜一碟啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:19.07,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,大家好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.99,0:07:19.40,Top,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳很厲害嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:21.49,Top,Karin,0,0,0,,我在漫畫上看過
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:22.90,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,只有我到現在一題都還沒答對！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.49,0:07:22.90,Top,Aoi,0,0,0,,是喔 哪一部？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.96,0:07:32.63,Text,Game,0,0,0,,問題：「音樂的三大要素」是節奏、旋律以及？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:37.03,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,和聲！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.01,0:07:43.01,Top,Game,0,0,0,,正確
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.45,0:07:47.82,Top,Game,0,0,0,,STAGE CLEAR
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.26,0:07:49.61,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好耶！
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.26,0:07:49.61,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.61,0:07:51.03,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,莉… 莉莉同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:53.07,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,不過是遊戲 不用這麼誇張…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.07,0:07:54.58,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,妳在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:56.64,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,妳自己不也玩得很開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.64,0:07:59.06,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳答對的時候看起來很開心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:01.49,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,那… 那是…！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:03.40,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,班長 好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:05.58,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,答對只是碰巧而已
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.58,0:08:07.18,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,別害羞 別害羞！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.18,0:08:08.85,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我… 我才沒有害羞！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.85,0:08:10.71,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不過妳真厲害 居然知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:13.00,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,那是我上才藝課時碰巧學到的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:15.62,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,班長好厲害！ 好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:25.91,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,今天要去遊樂場嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.91,0:08:28.73,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯… 我的零用錢可能有點吃緊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.73,0:08:30.32,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,喂 妳們幾個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.94,0:08:36.01,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,今… 今天不去…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.63,0:08:38.62,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,遊… 遊樂場嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.62,0:08:40.67,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,看起來超想去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.34,0:09:02.63,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.63,0:09:05.99,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,班長妳幹嘛偷偷摸摸地跟著我們啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.26,0:09:09.56,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,直接跟我們一起來不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.73,0:09:11.36,High,Lily,0,0,0,,妳這樣根本就是個忍者嘛！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.73,0:09:11.36,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,You're just like a ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.89,0:09:15.03,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這… 這個嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:20.38,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,因為上次來的時候 還不確定這裡能不能學到東西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:23.16,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,為了確認是否真的有幫助 我必須接觸各式各樣的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.16,0:09:25.83,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,如果一次無法理解就必須不斷挑戰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.83,0:09:28.04,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我只是為了做更詳細的調查才來的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:30.29,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,突… 突然開始長篇大論了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:32.36,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,其實為了今天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.36,0:09:35.85,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我還預習過遊樂場裡有哪些遊戲了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.29,0:09:38.81,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,班長幹勁十足呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.81,0:09:39.96,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,真有妳的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.96,0:09:42.94,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,格鬥遊戲 代幣遊戲 夾娃娃機…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:44.81,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,嗯 這裡大概都有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:46.31,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,真的嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.31,0:09:47.90,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,全部都玩一遍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.90,0:09:50.19,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,好 那我們就照順序玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:10:00.37,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,嘿… 妳的底子不錯…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.37,0:10:01.29,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.75,0:10:04.51,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,想贏我還早一百年呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:09.30,Top,Game,0,0,0,,K.O.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:11.50,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊 輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:13.30,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,師父好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.30,0:10:15.50,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,葵衣也盡力了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.50,0:10:18.55,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,加賀同學的手速好驚人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.55,0:10:21.15,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,說不定也能對打字有幫助呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.15,0:10:22.92,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,真會講話啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.24,0:10:25.78,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,好 班長也來試試看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:37.26,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,冷靜點 妳又在亂搖搖桿了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.81,0:10:40.24,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,班長 不能只會防守
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:41.57,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,要放膽進攻啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.14,0:10:46.86,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,竟然… 這麼… 困難…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.19,0:10:49.76,Text,Brown-Haired Guy,0,0,0,,身手不錯嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:52.94,Text,Glasses Guy,0,0,0,,是啊 我們也不能輸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.24,0:10:57.83,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,總覺得有股溫溫的視線…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.83,0:10:59.25,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,來吧 決勝負！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:03.21,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,剪刀… 石頭… 布！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:05.46,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,妳輸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.46,0:11:07.06,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,怎麼會一直輸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:08.85,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這台機器是不是作弊啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.88,0:11:11.39,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,來吧 決勝負！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.39,0:11:14.47,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,剪刀… 石頭… 布！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:16.35,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,你輸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.39,0:11:21.37,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,就跟妳說了那個遊戲是贏不了的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.37,0:11:25.05,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我可沒辦法教妳怎麼贏那個喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.05,0:11:26.87,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,沒問題 莉莉同學！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:29.12,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我現在就幫妳報仇！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:30.35,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,喂 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.35,0:11:31.51,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,來吧 決勝負！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.51,0:11:33.26,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,剪刀… 石頭…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:34.51,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,布！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.79,0:11:36.25,Top,Janken Game,0,0,0,,你輸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:38.53,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,果然是在作弊吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:44.48,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,真是個可怕的遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.48,0:11:46.49,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,下次我絕對不會輸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.49,0:11:49.30,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,是的 讓我們好好學習 下次雪恥吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.30,0:11:51.54,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我絕對不玩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:54.05,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,真是的 玩別的遊戲不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.05,0:11:56.51,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,不 我一定要雪恥！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:11:59.57,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.57,0:12:01.05,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:04.17,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,今天和大家一起來的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.17,0:12:08.00,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,小哥 差不多該做好和我對戰的覺悟了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.00,0:12:11.19,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不了 我打工很忙 沒什麼時間…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.19,0:12:12.50,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那就辭掉打工啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:14.57,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,真是的 別說些無理取鬧的話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.57,0:12:15.75,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.75,0:12:18.09,High,Lily,0,0,0,,今天有新的男子漢無尾熊商品嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.75,0:12:18.09,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Any new Mr. Koala stuff today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:19.18,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:23.03,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊 進了一些新的小東西和絨毛玩偶喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:24.34,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.65,0:12:25.97,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,無尾熊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.97,0:12:28.48,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,是某個遊戲的獎品嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:34.18,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,這個！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.18,0:12:36.23,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,是夾娃娃機啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:39.78,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,不過這個感覺好像學不到什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.73,0:12:42.78,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,格鬥遊戲 代幣遊戲…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:45.73,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,人生中所有的事情都能成為學習
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.13,0:12:48.61,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,莉莉想說的就是這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:52.51,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,原來如此… 說得有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.51,0:12:54.49,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這樣就說服她了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.71,0:12:57.65,High,Lily,0,0,0,,好吧！ 我來教你玩！
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.71,0:12:57.65,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,All right! I'll show you how to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.65,0:12:59.26,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,好… 好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:05.88,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,位置很不錯耶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:07.43,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,是啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:17.78,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,連夾娃娃機也能讓妳這樣喔？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.78,0:13:20.00,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,可… 可是移動了很多喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:22.29,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,只移動了三毫米左右吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.29,0:13:24.66,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,加賀同學 我正在安慰她耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:27.46,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這… 這難道說…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.28,0:13:33.62,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,是想透過親身體驗告訴我 人生並非總能一帆風順嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:35.29,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,絕對不是這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:37.25,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.56,0:13:37.25,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Renji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.25,0:13:38.26,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好 好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:40.27,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.29,0:13:44.57,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,大概這個位置可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:45.81,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.81,0:13:46.92,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.92,0:13:48.27,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.27,0:13:50.46,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這種偏袒的行為居然是被允許的嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.46,0:13:54.55,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不不不！ 這是店裡的規定啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.55,0:13:57.32,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,對於投幣超過一定金額的常客
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:13:59.37,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,可以提供這種服務！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.37,0:14:02.94,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,這代表在遇到困難時懂得求助也是很重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.29,0:14:04.62,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:08.81,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這也是出社會後必備的溝通能力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.81,0:14:11.80,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯… 就當作是這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:19.34,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,太好了 謝謝你 蓮司
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.61,0:14:20.87,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.45,0:14:25.01,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,班長不玩夾娃娃機嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:25.84,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:27.17,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.86,0:14:29.56,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我家啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.56,0:14:33.10,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,如果帶絨毛玩偶之類的東西回家 會被罵的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:36.58,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,雖然無尾熊很可愛 我很喜歡…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.97,0:14:38.66,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,班長…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.66,0:14:41.71,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這樣啊… 有沒有什麼辦法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:43.90,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,就算想偷偷帶回去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:45.77,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,絨毛玩偶也很顯眼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:47.82,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊… 那樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:54.00,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,如果是這種的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:56.67,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,掛在鉛筆盒之類的上面應該就不會被發現了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.03,0:14:59.68,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,的… 的確 如果是這個的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.68,0:15:01.51,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我試試看！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.87,0:15:07.81,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,結果根本夾不到嘛 店員先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.81,0:15:11.52,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不是啦 這個沒對準位置是夾不到的…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:12.88,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:15.79,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,從剛才開始就感覺快進去了卻又進不去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:30.01,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,要放棄嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:40.25,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.39,0:15:44.51,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這個遊戲還能學到不放棄的精神
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:47.43,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,就是這麼回事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.58,0:15:52.10,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,嘿 妳懂了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:54.68,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳絕對沒想那麼多吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:56.72,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這是最後…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:15:59.98,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,含淚的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.80,0:16:02.31,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,一次了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:18.58,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,夾到了…？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:20.15,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.15,0:16:21.20,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,哇！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.41,0:16:23.37,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,是堅持不懈的勝利呢 班長！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.37,0:16:24.70,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,幹得不錯嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:26.09,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,恭喜妳
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.09,0:16:29.34,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,等… 等一下 太誇張了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:30.58,Top,Renji,0,0,0,,妳越來越熟練了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:30.58,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,無尾熊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.91,0:16:36.60,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,身為班長
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:39.23,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,卻體驗到這麼開心的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.23,0:16:40.52,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,真的可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.03,0:16:52.27,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哎呀 今天玩了一整天的遊戲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.27,0:16:53.59,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.21,0:16:59.68,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,妳還真是學習認真呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:01.94,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我想把感想寫下來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.94,0:17:05.41,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,託大家的福 我玩到了很感興趣的遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.87,0:17:07.63,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.63,0:17:10.37,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,班長玩得開心就好！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:12.26,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊… 欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.58,0:17:15.02,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,那個妳還沒玩過吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.02,0:17:16.67,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,啊 這個是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.26,0:17:18.87,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,「大頭貼」…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:22.97,High,Lily,0,0,0,,哦 這叫照相亭是吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.56,0:17:22.97,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Oh, it's called a photo booth, ne?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.47,0:17:25.19,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,照相亭？
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.47,0:17:25.19,Text-English,Aoi,0,0,0,,Photo booth?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.90,0:17:27.52,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,欸 英文是這樣說的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:28.84,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,大家一起拍吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.84,0:17:29.89,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,好主意！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.70,0:17:34.00,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,那個… 我也想拍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.52,0:17:37.52,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,可是好像跟學習沒什麼關係
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.65,0:17:39.98,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,走吧！
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.65,0:17:39.98,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Let’s go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:46.79,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,這… 這就是大頭貼…！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.75,0:17:50.05,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,姿勢就用推薦的可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.05,0:17:50.78,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.78,0:17:52.08,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,拜託妳了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.41,0:17:55.04,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,我不拍喔 又不合我的風格
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.04,0:17:57.58,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,可是試著拍拍看說不定會很開心喔？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.58,0:17:58.72,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:18:03.14,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,而且班長妳不也覺得這跟學習沒關係嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:04.72,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,是沒錯…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.22,0:18:06.77,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,不過我在想
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:10.36,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,其實大頭貼是不是也能讓大家學習團隊合作呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.36,0:18:12.82,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,不 大頭貼學不到那個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.82,0:18:14.02,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,兩者沒什麼關係
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.02,0:18:16.10,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,事到如今竟然過河拆橋！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.10,0:18:17.76,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,是這樣啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.76,0:18:19.70,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,沒關係也無所謂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:21.64,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,今天已經學習很多了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.24,0:18:24.52,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我想和師父一起拍！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:27.50,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,不了… 我不太喜歡這種的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:30.99,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,拜託妳 師父…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:34.25,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,加賀同學 拜託妳了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:36.50,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我們大家一起拍吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.06,0:18:45.90,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,啊 真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:47.51,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,真拿妳們沒辦法啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.02,0:19:00.49,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,總覺得有點窄 讓人靜不下心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.49,0:19:02.26,Text,Print Club,0,0,0,,要開始拍攝囉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:06.03,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,各位 好像要站在這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.44,0:19:09.33,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,請按照大頭貼機的指示擺出姿勢喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.33,0:19:10.45,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:11.05,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.05,0:19:12.67,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,妳是大頭貼班長喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.67,0:19:14.79,Text,Print Club,0,0,0,,首先是兔子姿勢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:17.17,Text,Print Club,0,0,0,,用手做出耳朵的樣子 跳呀跳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.66,0:19:19.67,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,兔… 兔子姿勢…？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.99,0:19:21.84,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,是… 是這樣嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.84,0:19:23.95,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,兔子跳呀跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.95,0:19:25.95,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,莉莉 感覺不錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:29.51,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,真的要拍嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.05,0:19:30.93,Top,Print Club,0,0,0,,5
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.11,0:19:32.74,Top,Print Club,0,0,0,,4
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:33.44,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,要來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.81,0:19:34.59,Top,Print Club,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.95,0:19:36.25,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.19,0:19:36.10,Top,Print Club,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.25,0:19:37.38,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.44,0:19:37.86,Top,Aoi,0,0,0,,莉莉！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.47,0:19:40.28,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,拍得好厲害！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:42.51,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,抱歉 我靠得太近了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.51,0:19:45.30,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我… 我覺得很有躍動感 很不錯喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.30,0:19:47.16,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,喂 這個不能刪掉嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.16,0:19:48.45,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不能刪啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.05,0:19:51.13,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,眼睛是不是太大了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.13,0:19:52.86,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,大頭貼就是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.44,0:19:55.11,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,為什麼連哥哥都在！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.11,0:19:57.15,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,因為他在附近 就不小心…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.15,0:19:59.72,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,在附近就要把他拉進來嗎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.25,0:20:03.22,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,沒想到會這麼手忙腳亂…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.22,0:20:06.33,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,拍照前的過程意外地忙碌… 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.77,0:20:09.47,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,真是百聞不如一見呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.47,0:20:11.74,Text,Print Club,0,0,0,,下一個是最後的姿勢喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.17,0:20:14.86,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,呼… 總算啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.86,0:20:17.19,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,一定要擺好姿勢才行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.19,0:20:19.66,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,班長 妳太緊張了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:21.10,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,可… 可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.71,0:20:25.62,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,就算失敗也沒關係 對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:31.99,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,當然囉！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.99,0:20:33.38,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好期待！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.38,0:20:35.51,Text,Print Club,0,0,0,,變身成狂野女孩吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.51,0:20:38.63,Text,Print Club,0,0,0,,彎曲手指 大家一起擺出吼叫的姿勢！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.63,0:20:41.13,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,怎麼都是這種姿勢啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.13,0:20:43.90,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,那個… 彎曲手指…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.90,0:20:45.32,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,班長 這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.24,0:20:45.02,Top,Print Club,0,0,0,,5
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:46.51,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,好… 好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.67,0:20:46.51,Top,Print Club,0,0,0,,4
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.83,0:20:48.55,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,吼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.47,0:20:48.26,Top,Print Club,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.55,0:20:49.16,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.85,0:20:49.77,Top,Print Club,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:49.77,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.77,0:20:50.66,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,喂！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.77,0:20:50.66,Top,Print Club,0,0,0,,1
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.96,0:21:03.98,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,欸欸 班長
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.42,0:21:07.58,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,有… 有什麼事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.58,0:21:10.53,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,沒有啦 只是想說班長以前有戴這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.02,0:21:12.89,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,啊 妳說這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.89,0:21:14.55,Text,Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.55,0:21:16.67,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,妳在哪裡買的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.67,0:21:18.04,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.04,0:21:20.98,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,好像是在一家有點特別的店…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.98,0:21:22.14,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:24.39,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,欸 大概多少錢啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.39,0:21:27.89,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,我… 我不太記得了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.62,0:21:35.46,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,花了我大半的零用錢這種事… 我可說不出口啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.89,0:21:39.89,Text,Bangs-chan & Glasses-chan,0,0,0,,這個該不會… 是超高級品吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.59,0:21:44.34,Text,Bangs-chan,0,0,0,,班長 如果想起來了要跟我們說喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.34,0:21:45.66,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,好… 好的
Comment: 0,0:02:45.02,0:02:45.02,Default,OP,0,0,0,,-- OP --
